      "likelihood": "Medium",
      "explanation": "Prominent dizziness and visual disturbance with headache could reflect a basilar/vestibular migraine variant affecting posterior circulation pathways. This fits the combination of vertigo/dizziness, visual symptoms and vomiting without focal deficits.",
      "supporting_evidence": [
